# Optional. Leave empty to run the enquiry form in honest "demo mode" (nothing is sent).
#
# Set this to the URL of a form service or your own API route that accepts a JSON POST,
# for example a Formspree endpoint (https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx) or a Web3Forms /
# Netlify / Vercel function. See README.md > "Connecting the enquiry form".
#
# Only put PUBLIC endpoints here: anything prefixed VITE_ is bundled into the browser build.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
